of the StorageWorks box is that it has all the SCSI connections ready to go
(thus minimizing SCSI cable length), it has a built-in power supply sufficient
for all the drives, it can hold up to 7 3.5" devices, and it has a hot-swap
capability.  Are there 3rd party companies which make a deskside enclosure with
